      hu: ["Csendes alternatívát kínál a nyüzsgő üdülőhelyekkel szemben.", "A Six Men's Bay közelében található.", "Ideális hely a természet megfigyelésére.", "Főleg családi házakból áll."],
      ro: ["Oferă o alternativă liniștită la stațiunile aglomerate.", "Situat în apropierea golfului Six Men's Bay.", "Un loc ideal pentru observarea naturii.", "Compus în principal din case unifamiliale."],
      en: ["Offers a quiet alternative to busy resort areas.", "Located near the Six Men's Bay fishing village.", "An ideal spot for nature observation.", "Consists primarily of single-family residential homes."],
