      en: ["Population: approx. 500", "Elevation: 50 m (164 ft)", "Distance to Bridgetown: 8 km (5 mi)", "Annual rainfall: 1,300 mm (51 in)", "Number of shops: 5", "Historic sugar mill built: 1850"],
