      en: ["Population: approx. 800", "Elevation: 40 m (131 ft)", "Distance to Bridgetown: 5 km (3.1 mi)", "Distance to airport: 3 km (1.9 mi)", "Annual rainfall: 1,200 mm (47 in)", "First mentioned: 1650"],
