      en: ["Population: approx. 1,000 (part of Bridgetown)", "Elevation: 10 m (33 ft)", "Distance to port: 1 km (0.62 mi)", "Historic coal depot built: 1890", "Bus routes: 2, 5, 7", "Number of shopping centers: 2"],
