      hu: ["Széles kilátást nyújt a környékre.", "A helyi falusi közösség központja.", "Történelmi ültetvényutak közelében található.", "Csendes életmód jellemzi."],
      ro: ["Oferă o vedere largă asupra împrejurimilor.", "Un centru pentru comunitatea locală a satului.", "Situat lângă drumuri istorice de plantație.", "Caracterizat printr-un mod de viață liniștit."],
      en: ["Offers expansive views of the surrounding valley.", "A center for the local village community.", "Located near historical plantation trails.", "Characterized by a tranquil and traditional pace of life."],
