      hu: ["Itt található a Vaucluse Factory központ.", "Környezetvédelmi projektek fontos helyszíne.", "A Harrison's Cave közelében található.", "Dombos terep jellemzi."],
      ro: ["Găzduiește centrul Vaucluse Factory.", "Locație importantă pentru proiecte ecologice.", "Situat în apropierea Peșterii Harrison.", "Caracterizat printr-un teren deluros."],
      en: ["Home to the Vaucluse Factory resource center.", "An important site for island environmental projects.", "Located in close proximity to Harrison's Cave.", "Characterized by hilly and verdant terrain."],
