      en: "Saint Simons is a small village in the parish of Saint Andrew. It is nestled in the dramatic hilly landscape of the Scotland District.",
      es: "Saint Simons es un pequeño pueblo en la parroquia de Saint Andrew. Se encuentra en el espectacular paisaje de colinas del Scotland District.",
      pt: "Saint Simons é uma pequena aldeia na paróquia de Saint Andrew. Situa-se na dramática paisagem de colinas do Scotland District.",
      fr: "Saint Simons est un petit village de la paroisse de Saint Andrew. Il est situé dans le paysage vallonné spectaculaire du Scotland District.",
